# SIH26133 — Tech Stack & AI Workflow Document
### Rural Healthcare Referral & Follow-up Coordination Platform

---

## 0. One-line positioning (don't lose this)

> **Not a telemedicine app. Not an AI doctor. A referral-closure and care-continuity engine that plugs into ABDM/eSanjeevani, built ASHA-first, works offline, and only "closes" a case when the patient actually received care.**

Every tech decision below is made to protect that positioning — nothing here should quietly turn this into a generic hospital app.

